  "body": "Direct-PR: ledger-note of #924, applied by hand (AGENTS §8)\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: opus-5.5 (cloud/orch)\nReviewer model: fable-5.2 (cloud/orch-rev940)\n\n#924's `ledger-note`: `docs/CHANGELOG-LEGACY.md` rows 96 and 594, shown in the app's « Nouveautés », became false with #924. They are rewritten from the note:\n- row 96: the page menus use legacy's labels again (« Page 1 », « Page … », the last pages, « Dernier post »), in the top « … » and the bottom « N / M ».\n- row 594: the message menu opens at the tapped « + » (the legacy glyph) as the system's horizontal callout with « › » for the other actions, like legacy's edit menu.\n\nOnly these two rows change. The legacy pointers are unchanged.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_\n",
